### createAccount
POST http://localhost:8080/api/account/create?
    accountNumber={{$random.alphanumeric(8)}}

### findAccount
@id = 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/account/{{id}}/balance

### deposit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/account/{{id}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": {{id}},
  "balanceType": "STANDARD",
  "amount": 1000
}

### withdraw
POST http://localhost:8080/api/account/{{id}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": {{id}},
  "balanceType": "STANDARD",
  "amount": 200
}